    {
        "content": "<p>alexcrichton <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14914#issuecomment-6324037305\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14914\">PR #14914</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Personally I'd probably say that this doesn't really need a note until after stabilization. The decision to enable-by-default without fuzzing isn't really mine alone to make, and until that's decided it's not quite accurate to say that fuzzing isn't required for this proposal. Rather I think the <span aria-label=\"x\" class=\"emoji emoji-274e\" role=\"img\" title=\"x\">:x:</span> correctly reflects how it doesn't currently have fuzzing, and we can keep it in the back of our heads for discussion when this comes up for enabling by default.</p>\n</blockquote>",
